# Build context for `podman build` (podman/buildah also honor this name; a
# .containerignore would take precedence if one ever appears). The Containerfile
# copies exactly two files, entrypoint.sh and scripts/lib-env.sh; everything
# else is repo metadata or host runtime state. Without these rules every image
# build tars up the whole project directory, including the multi-GB Steam depot
# under data/ and the staged mod builds, plus the git-ignored .env secrets.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!scripts/lib-env.sh
